  "description": "Passwordless login and authentication for ASP.NET Core: an OpenID Connect (OIDC) provider built on OpenIddict, with login through Telegram, WhatsApp, Instagram, Messenger, WeChat, Viber, MAX or email, and approval of sensitive actions. Your users scan a QR code on the sign-in page (on a phone, they tap a button) and confirm with one tap in their messaging app — no password, no SMS code. Your users can sign in this way on a computer, a TV, a kiosk or any other device that can show a QR code.",
